!=======================================================================
! Input file for inflow-outflow boundary layer code
!

5   nsteps      number of time steps to run
0.     timeLimit   stopping time (0.=ignore)
24.    whours      wall hours (for SGI only; should be <= time in rundefs)
1      iprint      interval to print out diagnostic information
1      ipout       interval to print out restart file (might be same as iprint????)
0      istat       Calculate statistics?  Sampling interval
2800.  Re          Reynolds number (based on the total viscosity)
0      iSGS        Use a subgrid-scale model?

! use symmetric projector before simulation
1      isymproj

! Time-step control
0         iCFL        Run at (1) constant CFL number   (0) constant dt
0.2       CFLlimit    maximum allowable CFL number
0         flag_newdt  Changed time step?
0.005    dt          time step

! Inflow generation
0      inflow      Type of inflow: (0)laminar (1)data file
0      inflowFluct (0)none (1)random (2)OS disc. (3)OS cont. (4)FST (5)2D+3D (6)multiple OS cont
1.     ubulk        bulk velocity for laminar inflow

! Boundary condition for each face
1      BC_bottom   Type of boundary condition: (0)free slip (1)no slip (2) periodic 
1      BC_top      Type of boundary condition: (0)free slip (1)no slip (2) periodic
2      BC_left     Type of boundary condition: (1)prescribed-inflow    (2) periodic
2      BC_right    Type of boundary condition: (1)convective-outflow   (2) periodic
2      BC_back     Type of boundary condition: (0)free slip (1)no slip (2) periodic
2      BC_front    Type of boundary condition: (0)free slip (1)no slip (2) periodic

! For reading observation files
2      iassim        (0) normal DNS (1) write observation (2) read observation, write flux
1      ifric	     (0) skin friction is not observed (1)  skin friction is observed
1      isubdomain    (0) subdomain field  not observed (1)  subdomain field  observed
1      ObsStart      start number of observation files
5      ObsEnd        end number of observation files
1           ObsNt          how many time-steps between two observation files 
1      istart
24      iend
4      iskip
1      jstart 
24     jend
4      jskip
1      kstart
24     kend
4      kskip
0.  sigma

! Animation
4 	ianim
0.2  	save_dt
5   nsave_Rstrt  Time interval for writing restart file

! Quick parameters
0.00       x_QUICK       Pre-multiply the Quadratic Upstream Interpolation by (x_QUICK)

! Poisson solver - multigrid parameter
6        ngrid       Number of grid levels
5        ncycle      Number of V-cycles through grid levels
3        npre        Number of pre-iterations/relaxations at each level 
100      nitmax      Maximum number of iterations
200      nitmaxb     Maximum number of iterations at base level
1.e-12   resmin      Minimum residual
1.e-14   resminb     Minimum residual at base level
1.00     omegak1     Relaxation parameter for multigrid solver
1.00     omegakn     Relaxation parameter for multigrid solver

! More stuff for Xiahua's code
4        iprob       (4) turbine blade 
2        ipoisson    NOT USED
0        iread_avt   Read average data?

! Pressure gradient
1 			iPrj	 	(0)fixed dpdx (1)fixed mdot
-3.214056E-06	GPxi     	Fixed pressure gradient (time average from fixed mdot code)

